<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="5f24b01c32f94102b190eae5cc763bf8">说明：场景配置、规则、因子变更通知使用指南</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="ce9056b0e1d34a7f90e67939ef758fd0" />
<h2 nodeId="e9bb28c9371b4b7caad11ace573666d3">一、背景</h2>
<p nodeId="f09333b824304977b077c2f70d7ddb72">在场景配置、规则、因子发生变动且会对线上产生直接影响时，需要大象通知相关人员，以应变突发情况。</p>
<ul nodeId="35afd79ad9584c558e482cb650a259b6">
<li nodeId="c1b96c13d5e54b2dae525dfe645df49b">场景配置中的某条规则由标记改为生效时，该业务的其他人能有感知，并显示规则标记时的命中量</li>
<li nodeId="2c7a4d9cc1be4af6b75a77b8e7af2a15">规则的表达式被更改时，且该规则在某些场景配置中处于生效状态，则应该通知相关策略和业务人员</li>
<li nodeId="19fd6cc97ecc44b79ca5d26bff596f4c">因子的表达式被更改，若其对应的规则在某些场景配置中处于生效状态，希望能通知相关人员</li>
</ul>
<h2 nodeId="8cd32b3dbc1e4148841f6e3b0116d7ec">二、配置指南</h2>
<ol nodeId="f10c65dbaceb4d0e9a1c64b11d72b3cf">
<li nodeId="6f11e7d6c9994128ab8417efc349b0e8">进入 <span color="rgb(29, 120, 205)"><strong>权限 —&gt; 业务管理 </strong></span>导航栏，查找需要通知的业务点击进行入 <span color="rgb(29, 120, 205)"><strong>业务更新</strong></span> 页面</li>
<li nodeId="89e10e670d9c4649b6f26843a4a065bb">
<p nodeId="425fa5b40b0040479574fdbf4f1378df">在 <span color="rgb(29, 120, 205)"><strong>业务更新</strong></span> 页面修改 变更通知人</p>
<ol nodeId="abf701adcbb14d60990cf831edc1664d">
<li nodeId="6faefe38d42c4070b62f8db9a7e1ab6f"> <img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/56487220/57250245" name="image.png" width="598" height="294" nodeId="af8f821f7c7e4ee4be132f49fa8710f8" /></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="6ba84898408444a085edff9aa5908d8f">点击 更新 按钮即可完成对通知者的配置</li>
</ol>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="46684619f8b84c17a224c7f74fec6ac2">
<km-title>注</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="390eef97178c4cadac2cbbbcb420265a">只有业务的负责人才有权限更新业务方信息，包括修改变更通知人</p>
<p nodeId="169673151b5f4886b2c4409c9726abbb">变更通知人由英文逗号间隔，可以自由设置，可以设置通知非Zeus用户</p>
<p nodeId="872e24f96d834787b1fe1af8d459de7d">目前只支持大象通知</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<h2 nodeId="288370dd56ff4395bdd23fdfa41fedfc">三、通知内容说明</h2>
<ol nodeId="8eb5a2003cf64426af9b30c1caceb54e">
<li nodeId="6887656ef72641fcb36aea6f272d860a">
<p nodeId="1ae893bcad5b41ee91edb05dfe3a5589">场景配置变更通知</p>
<ol nodeId="e09099e3cbdb454ab35e5cb00ec86df5">
<li nodeId="64ddba67cf3a4472a0a1ff82212b1b86">
<p nodeId="9fc5ad7e2e3543a3a0ee530020350f9a">当场景配置被修改成功时会发生通知</p>
<ol nodeId="f9e6fc5ecb28408fb466fddd27e67b8e">
<li nodeId="44cacac1c91d45aea7d8f7c0326a9e01">
<p nodeId="0f46ea5036ee4c4aa62979a3b216a494">场景配置由标记改为生效，会大象通知该场景所在业务的变更通知人，并显示规则标记的时长和命中量</p>
<ol nodeId="e33a2d17d23b4cdd8e07f097d1c46627">
<li nodeId="bad0c954ebe14eb9822c96d0c8620ecc"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/56487220/57272085" name="image.png" width="478" height="256" nodeId="5ca707bfc2404a7fb93605806f5eaadb" /></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="0dca3e55f261423189e86f37f5d42ac4">场景配置发生其他变更操作也会通知相关人员</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="c5df6d8b7a2d4a60b6d2781eb7a41ad0">
<p nodeId="9c41539cb6824ddca2fb0586367a8083">规则变更通知</p>
<ol nodeId="437d5d85f51e4e2b968115a3a26fc3ab">
<li nodeId="d0b671be38714f02acdfe3bf5c61b431">
<p nodeId="ec17d19be4114c138a89912c2dd0fc70">当规则在某些场景下为生效状态时，修改规则表达式内容成功会触发大象通知</p>
<ol nodeId="68af941de6ca4b018378e69f6666f77d">
<li nodeId="23aa2f68b1834a8b9b5b40dd5ff3246f">通知人：该规则共享的所有业务方的变更通知者的集合</li>
<li nodeId="144b1ef4ed7848a7889d5495a8adea42">通知内容：影响的生效场景配置个数以及规则表达式被修改提示信息</li>
<li nodeId="07a6cbff6f1243d4bda3c215c9d85897"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/56487220/57251301" name="image.png" width="415" height="315" nodeId="9947012359d340c28195122685ea0199" /></li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="b4caa943253546ce9f4c91bd717d8878">
<p nodeId="4b5e778898e44e309af819bb8874a815">因子变更通知</p>
<ol nodeId="8816c3876eb941ad840ecf1033574a43">
<li nodeId="61ef7cfa388a493aae041769badcee9e">
<p nodeId="f859b8f5337f4c198875b190f8c5ee91">当因子被某些规则使用，且这些规则在某些场景中处于生效状态，因子被成功修改会触发通知操作</p>
<ol nodeId="60be27997a0e474abfb01dcaf31e9291">
<li nodeId="aff5ea1a053940b397af23c1ffdf1d9a">通知人：该因子所共享的业务方的变更通知者的集合</li>
<li nodeId="5b0eb6fff9aa444f9f9f6869dd090c8b">
<p nodeId="cd0f88e297524f21ae655ed99bc23298">通知内容：</p>
<ol nodeId="1339ffe1042c4fc3ac5eb8882b7fc435">
<li nodeId="e9e98dbf40734403a0096ef4030c5f8c">
<p nodeId="14c78501a7e1457b86e425a78d412086">普通因子</p>
<ol nodeId="6d9753ff0eb84dd5813fe26cf27de7cf">
<li nodeId="e7ccd4692782459e809fb366c1a0f1a1">影响的生效场景配置数量</li>
<li nodeId="06d0611c7f1a45c8bfea4dc78188ffb4">表达式是否发生变更</li>
<li nodeId="ca0d04f7570342c9bd6013a11d87f1a7">因子类型是否发生变更，变更前后分别是什么</li>
<li nodeId="df710189a68442ddabafc14eb7da326c"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/56487220/57187821" name="image.png" width="403" height="343" nodeId="cf701beacd8f4643a35ba6df5085bacb" /></li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="c50f6dbec36c415abdd23ab5a6eb0e3c">
<p nodeId="e65c256fe4ba4750be39d55e4b33c1c2">累计因子</p>
<ol nodeId="52a5b208005d4db1bdd71c7cafad55c0">
<li nodeId="d847ee7981b1469e912e6561b0de21f9">影响的生效场景配置数量</li>
<li nodeId="c8c7f10055e446b290454bd9e79ee7a1">累计因子的累计事件ID，累计周期，按何累计，累计字段、求各项等属性是否发生变更</li>
<li nodeId="b860409215e043adb57a9998a414d8ca"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/56487220/57272789" name="image.png" width="624" height="259" nodeId="6704d3a1e9914da5995c3031f46ea299" /></li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li nodeId="972e67ed898c45549ee07e5fb8eeff43">通知内容注</li>
</ol>
<km-note type="tip" nodeId="612726c1ab674cadb6b71747832c095d">
<km-title>重要</km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="d951fdee858d467e8c833b20a30cb9f8">表达式属于敏感私密信息，为了安全性考虑，推送消息时不对表达式变更前后的内容进行展示，只提示表达式发生了改变。</p>
<p nodeId="9d802d0b43dc4e66af0d07e128584d66">在点击链接查看更改后的场景配置、规则或因子时，需要用户当前业务能匹配场景配置、规则或因子所在的业务，否则显示可能为空</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
